title: "Exact total variation for finite sampling from a population with one repeated pair"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Towell
    given-names: Alexander Richard
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6443-9897"
    email: lex@metafunctor.com
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - total variation
  - sampling without replacement
  - finite exchangeability
  - Lean
  - formal verification
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization of the exact signed total-variation mass between the
  specified with- and without-replacement sampling laws for a population
  identifying one pair. Includes pinned dependencies, exact API and axiom
  audits, boundary consumers, rejecting controls and independent finite evidence.
  Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed. No novelty, human peer
  review, upstream acceptance or arbitrary IID-mixture optimality is claimed.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23724873"
